  <title>PO payment matching</title>

  <p>The <gui>PO payment matching</gui> button of the <link
  xref="main_reports_window"/> lists purchase orders with the date each was
  paid, the account it was paid from, and the check number or description of
  the payment. Choose the <gui>Vendor</gui>, or check <gui>View all</gui>. An
  order with no date paid has not been paid yet.</p>

